  <div class="callout-title">💡 Agent-Specific Advice</div>
  <p>For agents, run full trajectory evals only on a small "critical path" dataset (10–30 examples). Use assertion evals to catch structural failures on every commit. Reserve trajectory judges for the most complex agent flows where path correctness matters as much as the answer. AgentOps' time-travel debugging is uniquely valuable for root-causing multi-step failures — no other tool lets you replay an agent run from an arbitrary midpoint.</p>
