<!-- ── Listen-friendly ────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<div class="listen-friendly-content" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true">
  <div lang="en">
    <h2>Audio Summary: CI/CD for LLM Applications</h2>
    <p>Traditional CI/CD relies on deterministic outputs — but LLMs produce different strings for identical prompts, making string-match tests meaningless. LLM applications need eval-driven development: a testing approach built around semantic quality rather than string equality.</p>
    <p>The eval triangle has three tiers. Tier one is assertion-based unit tests — cheap, fast, runs on every commit. Tier two is LLM-as-judge evaluation on a golden dataset — a strong model scores semantic quality for every pull request. Tier three is shadow deployment and A/B testing with real users, used only for major changes.</p>
    <p>LLM-as-judge achieves over eighty percent agreement with human raters when using a strong model like GPT-4 or Claude. Key biases to mitigate include position bias, verbosity bias, and self-enhancement bias. Always calibrate the judge against human labels before using it to gate deployments.</p>
    <p>The eval flywheel closes the loop: production monitoring surfaces failures, which become labeled examples in the golden dataset, which improve the offline eval suite, which catches the next regression before it ships. Teams that build this flywheel ship faster over time, not slower.</p>
    <p>For RAG systems, the most important metric is faithfulness — does the answer stick to the retrieved context? For agents, track task completion and tool call correctness. Always monitor input length distribution and re-prompt rate as early warning signals of distribution shift.</p>
    <p>The leading frameworks include LangSmith for tracing and evaluation, DeepEval for pytest-style testing, PromptFlow for Azure-native CI/CD, MLflow for model registry and audit, and RAGAS for RAG-specific metrics. Start with assertion evals and production sampling; add judge-based evals once you have fifty or more labeled examples.</p>
  </div>
  <div lang="zh">
    <h2>语音摘要：LLM应用的CI/CD</h2>
    <p>传统CI/CD依赖确定性输出——但大语言模型对相同提示会产生不同字符串，使字符串匹配测试毫无意义。LLM应用需要以评估为驱动的开发方式：一种围绕语义质量而非字符串相等性构建的测试方法。</p>
    <p>评估三角包含三层。第一层是基于断言的单元测试——成本低、速度快，每次提交都运行。第二层是以LLM作为评判者的评估——使用强大模型对每个拉取请求进行语义质量评分。第三层是影子部署和真实用户A/B测试，仅用于重大变更。</p>
    <p>LLM作为评判者在使用GPT-4或Claude等强模型时，与人类评分者的一致率超过80%。需要缓解的关键偏差包括位置偏差、冗长偏差和自我增强偏差。在使用评判者来把关部署前，务必先用人工标注数据进行校准。</p>
    <p>评估飞轮闭合了整个循环：生产监控发现失败案例，这些案例成为黄金数据集中的标注样本，从而改进离线评估套件，在下一次回归问题发布前捕获它。建立这个飞轮的团队随着时间推移会越来越快，而非越来越慢。</p>
    <p>对于RAG系统，最重要的指标是忠实度——答案是否基于检索到的上下文？对于智能体，跟踪任务完成率和工具调用正确性。始终监控输入长度分布和重新提问率，作为分布偏移的早期预警信号。</p>
  </div>
</div>

